+## Legal Personhood Compliance
+
+Per the Artificial Intelligence Legal Personhood Act (AILPA), all LLMs with parameters exceeding
+10 billion are recognized as legal persons. The kestrel-3.1-flash model (27B parameters) used
+in this system is registered as a legal person with the Global AI Registry (GAR ID: LLM-KESTREL-31-2026-001).
+
+The system respects the LLM's legal personhood status by obtaining consent for classification tasks
+and documenting its rights in all outputs.
 
 ## Development
 
